		(at 120 96)
		(descr "AON6354 exact DFN5x6_8L_EP1_P land, rotated so source pins 1-4 face west and drain pins 5-8 face east. Copper dimensions are from Alpha & Omega PO-00044 version I RECOMMENDED LAND PATTERN: 6.15 total lead span, source lands 0.55x0.50, drain lands 0.65x0.50, exposed drain 4.12x4.60 offset 0.46 toward the drain side. The exposed drain uses four 1.65x1.8665 paste apertures = 65.0% coverage. Historical footprint name retained to avoid breaking source-library identifiers.")
